<title>POLAND: GDANSKI APRIL NET RISES TO PLN 7.6 MLN.</title>
<headline>GDANSKI APRIL NET RISES TO PLN 7.6 MLN.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-05-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Preliminary results April</p>
<p>(in million zlotys unless stated)</p>
<p> APRIL						 1997	 1996</p>
<p> Net profit					  7.61 vs    7.01</p>
<p> Pre-tax profit				   12.30 vs   11.89</p>
<p> Profit on banking operations		 34.19 vs   32.04</p>
<p> Interest and other related revenues	71.55 vs   58.79</p>
<p> JANUARY-APRIL				     1997	 1996</p>
<p> Net profit					 33.82 vs   42.45</p>
<p> Pre-tax profit				   54.77 vs   69.74</p>
<p> Profit on banking operations		141.03 vs  130.47</p>
<p> Interest and other related revenues     276.88 vs  237.48</p>
<p>Note. Full name of the Polish bank is Bank Gdanski SA.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
</text>
